---

<section id="leadership" class="py-20 md:py-32 relative">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
        
        <div class="mb-12 md:mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-4 uppercase">
            Leadership & <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 to-emerald-400">Impact</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="w-20 h-1.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-emerald-500 rounded-full"></div>
        <p class="mt-6 text-gray-400 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed">
            Writing code is only half the equation. I pride myself on my ability to communicate effectively, build communities, and take initiative outside of the IDE.
        </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:gap-10">

        <div class="group bg-[#1e2330]/80 backdrop-blur-sm border border-gray-700/50 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-blue-500/50 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(59,130,246,0.1)] transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col">
            
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start justify-between mb-6 gap-4">
            <div>
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-500/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 border border-blue-500/20 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
                <span class="text-blue-400 text-2xl">🤝</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">Founder & President</h3>
                <h4 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-400 mt-1">4-H Club, USTP-CDO</h4>
            </div>
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-blue-300 bg-blue-500/10 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-blue-500/20 whitespace-nowrap">
                2024
            </span>
            </div>

            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-1">
            Identified a gap in campus organizations and took the initiative to found the university's 4-H Club chapter. Led executive meetings, delegated tasks to committee members, and spearheaded community-focused youth and agricultural initiatives from the ground up.
            </p>

            <div class="pt-6 border-t border-gray-700/50">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Key Competencies</p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <span class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-400 bg-[#151923] px-3 py-1 rounded-md">Team Management</span>
                <span class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-400 bg-[#151923] px-3 py-1 rounded-md">Project Scoping</span>
                <span class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-400 bg-[#151923] px-3 py-1 rounded-md">Public Speaking</span>
            </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="group bg-[#1e2330]/80 backdrop-blur-sm border border-gray-700/50 rounded-2xl p-8 hover:border-emerald-500/50 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(16,185,129,0.1)] transition-all duration-300 flex flex-col">
            
            <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-start justify-between mb-6 gap-4">
            <div>
                <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-500/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-4 border border-emerald-500/20 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
                <span class="text-emerald-400 text-2xl">🎨</span>
                </div>
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Creative Lead & SMM</h3>
                <h4 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-400 mt-1">University Student Government</h4>
            </div>
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-emerald-300 bg-emerald-500/10 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/20 whitespace-nowrap">
                2023 &mdash; 2025
            </span>
            </div>

            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6 flex-1">
            Managed the digital presence and visual branding for the student government. Translated complex government initiatives and event details into clear, accessible, and highly engaging digital assets for the entire student body.
            </p>

            <div class="pt-6 border-t border-gray-700/50">
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Key Competencies</p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <span class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-400 bg-[#151923] px-3 py-1 rounded-md">Visual Communication</span>
                <span class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-400 bg-[#151923] px-3 py-1 rounded-md">Brand Consistency</span>
                <span class="text-xs font-medium text-gray-400 bg-[#151923] px-3 py-1 rounded-md">Digital Strategy</span>
            </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>